# Backend build context (swu-game root). Exclude data/ (the ~2GB image cache +
# live saves — mounted as a volume at runtime), the frontend (its own image),
# and regenerable/heavy dirs. Everything ELSE is shipped by `COPY . .` because the
# backend imports scripts.audit_coverage and reads tests/fixtures/*.json at runtime
# — so scripts/ and tests/ must NOT be excluded here.
data/
.venv/
web/
__pycache__/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.pytest_cache/
.hypothesis/
.git/
*.log
